---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const servicesHero = "https://ikosluxurydevelopments.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/IKOS-Design-WMK.jpg";
---

<Layout title="The Design Atelier — IKOS Luxury Developments" description="Detailing our four execution pillars: Custom Architecture, Global Material Procurement, International Interior Design Partnerships, and Premium Landscaping.">
  
  <!-- SERVICES HERO (Light Luxury Style) -->
  <section class="relative w-full h-[45vh] overflow-hidden flex items-end bg-linen border-b border-bronze/10">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
      <img 
        src={servicesHero} 
        alt="Architectural Material Curation" 
        class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-15" 
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-linen via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 w-full pb-12">
      <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 mb-3">
        <span class="w-8 h-px bg-bronze-dark max-w-8"></span>
        <span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-epic text-bronze-dark font-semibold">THE DESIGN ATELIER</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-serif text-obsidian tracking-tight uppercase">Our Services & Execution Pillars</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- INTRO PILLARS TEXT -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-linen relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12">
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-bronze-dark block font-semibold mb-3">01 — EXECUTION PHILOSOPHY</span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-4xl font-serif text-obsidian tracking-tight leading-tight uppercase">
          Uncompromising <br />
          <span class="italic font-light text-bronze-dark">End-to-End Control</span>
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 text-sm text-obsidian/75 leading-relaxed font-sans font-light space-y-6">
        <p>
          At IKOS, we do not believe in fragmented project handoffs. The traditional divide between architects, general contractors, material suppliers, and landscape artists introduces visual compromise, timeline inflation, and structural risk.
        </p>
        <p>
          Instead, we operate as a fully integrated, end-to-end design-build atelier. From initial wind-channel simulation and topographic layout to the final custom millwork fitting and evergreen forest transplant, every single coordinate of your estate is managed under one unified operational shield.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FOUR INTEGRATED EXECUTION PILLARS -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-white/40 border-y border-bronze/10 relative">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12">
      
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-16">
        <span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-epic text-bronze-dark block font-semibold mb-2">CURATION PILLARS</span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-4xl font-serif text-obsidian tracking-tight uppercase">The Four Pillars of Mastery</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        
        <!-- Pillar 1 -->
        <div class="bg-white/60 border border-bronze/10 p-8 relative group hover:border-bronze-dark transition-all duration-500 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-8 h-8 border-t border-r border-bronze/15 group-hover:border-bronze-dark transition-colors duration-500"></div>
          <div>
            <span class="text-2xl font-serif text-bronze-dark/30 block mb-4 font-semibold">01</span>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-serif text-obsidian mb-3 font-semibold">Custom Architecture</h3>
            <p class="text-xs md:text-sm text-obsidian/75 leading-relaxed font-sans font-light">
              We design legendary residential structures engineered specifically for Calgary's unique natural contours and harsh sub-zero microclimates. Utilizing structural glass envelopes, board-formed concrete shear walls, and self-heating travertine limestone terraces, our architecture dissolves the boundaries between human shelter and the raw Alberta wilderness.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="border-t border-bronze/10 pt-4 mt-6 flex justify-between items-center text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-bronze-dark font-medium">
            <span>Environmental Contour Scans</span>
            <span>Est. Phase-01</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Pillar 2 -->
        <div class="bg-white/60 border border-bronze/10 p-8 relative group hover:border-bronze-dark transition-all duration-500 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-8 h-8 border-t border-r border-bronze/15 group-hover:border-bronze-dark transition-colors duration-500"></div>
          <div>
            <span class="text-2xl font-serif text-bronze-dark/30 block mb-4 font-semibold">02</span>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-serif text-obsidian mb-3 font-semibold">Global Product & Material Procurement</h3>
            <p class="text-xs md:text-sm text-obsidian/75 leading-relaxed font-sans font-light">
              To guarantee visual and structural continuity, we bypass local supply houses and manage our own international material pipeline. We procure bookmatched Calacatta marble blocks straight from Tuscan quarries, high-performance structural double-glazing frames from Deno-tested workshops, and hand-applied Marmorino plaster powders from Venetian artisans.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="border-t border-bronze/10 pt-4 mt-6 flex justify-between items-center text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-bronze-dark font-medium">
            <span>Direct Quarry Logistics</span>
            <span>Est. Phase-02</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Pillar 3 -->
        <div class="bg-white/60 border border-bronze/10 p-8 relative group hover:border-bronze-dark transition-all duration-500 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-8 h-8 border-t border-r border-bronze/15 group-hover:border-bronze-dark transition-colors duration-500"></div>
          <div>
            <span class="text-2xl font-serif text-bronze-dark/30 block mb-4 font-semibold">03</span>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-serif text-obsidian mb-3 font-semibold">International Interior Design Partnerships</h3>
            <p class="text-xs md:text-sm text-obsidian/75 leading-relaxed font-sans font-light">
              We form exclusive, end-to-end design alliances with elite international interior design firms in Milan, Paris, and Athens. By marrying our local structural frameworks with their global curation expertise, we create deeply personal interior galleries complete with shadow-line baseline detailing, museum-grade lighting, and custom-rubbed architectural bronze plating.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="border-t border-bronze/10 pt-4 mt-6 flex justify-between items-center text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-bronze-dark font-medium">
            <span>Bespoke Interior Ateliers</span>
            <span>Est. Phase-03</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Pillar 4 -->
        <div class="bg-white/60 border border-bronze/10 p-8 relative group hover:border-bronze-dark transition-all duration-500 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-8 h-8 border-t border-r border-bronze/15 group-hover:border-bronze-dark transition-colors duration-500"></div>
          <div>
            <span class="text-2xl font-serif text-bronze-dark/30 block mb-4 font-semibold">04</span>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-serif text-obsidian mb-3 font-semibold">Premium Site Landscaping</h3>
            <p class="text-xs md:text-sm text-obsidian/75 leading-relaxed font-sans font-light">
              An architectural monument is only as elegant as the earth it rests upon. We manage complete environmental restoration and mature landscape transplantation. We select, secure, and transplant mature local lodgepole pines, maples, and mountain evergreens to ensure your estate feels immediately anchored, private, and rooted in Alberta's natural majesty.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="border-t border-bronze/10 pt-4 mt-6 flex justify-between items-center text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-bronze-dark font-medium">
            <span>Topographic Restoration</span>
            <span>Est. Phase-04</span>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- MATERIAL COLLAGE / EXTRA INFO -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-linen relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
      
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-4">
        <span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-epic text-bronze-dark block font-semibold">THE CHRONOLOGY OF THE BUILD</span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-4xl font-serif text-obsidian tracking-tight uppercase">Our Rigorous Schedule Discipline</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-obsidian/70 leading-relaxed font-sans font-light">
          Under the operational leadership of Stamos Chalapas, every single IKOS commission is mapped across a tight sequence of scheduled risk gates. We run real-time telemetry diagnostics on each active work site, monitoring concrete curing indices, underfloor radiant pressure points, and structural glass sealing parameters.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-obsidian/70 leading-relaxed font-sans font-light">
          This algorithmic project discipline completely protects our clients from the cost overruns and delays that affect ordinary bespoke homes, bringing total financial transparency to the luxury residential sector.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-6 overflow-hidden border border-bronze/10 aspect-video bg-white">
        <img 
          src="https://ikosluxurydevelopments.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/IKOS-Kitchen7-1-WMK.jpg" 
          alt="The Glass Pavilion architectural geometry" 
          class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale opacity-90 hover:opacity-100 transition-all duration-1000"
        />
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-white/40 border-t border-bronze/10 text-center">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 flex flex-col items-center">
      <span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-epic text-bronze-dark font-semibold mb-3">THE CHRONOLOGY BEGINS WITH YOU</span>
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-serif text-obsidian mb-4 uppercase">Ready to initiate your custom site analysis?</h2>
      <p class="text-xs text-obsidian/60 max-w-xl leading-relaxed font-sans font-light mb-6">
        Our curators are standing by to conduct initial topographical contour mapping and architectural scoping sessions.
      </p>
      <a href="/inquire" class="bg-obsidian hover:bg-bronze-dark text-linen hover:text-obsidian font-semibold px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full text-xs uppercase tracking-widest transition-all duration-300">
        Initiate Site Scoping
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
